---
import { appLabel, appUrl, sourceUrl } from "../lib/site";
---

<section id="open-source" class="section trust-section" aria-labelledby="trust-title">
  <div class="container trust-layout">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">OPEN CODE. CLEAR BOUNDARIES.</p>
      <h2 id="trust-title">看得见源码，<br />也看得清边界。</h2>
      <p>选择工具之前，先了解它如何运行、由谁授权，以及哪些能力仍需验证。</p>
      {sourceUrl && <a class="text-link" href={sourceUrl}>浏览源代码 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>}
    </div>
    <dl class="trust-facts">
      <div>
        <dt>开源与素材许可</dt>
        <dd>自有代码采用 <a href="/LICENSE">AGPL-3.0-only</a>；第三方字体、代码和素材保留原许可。<a href="/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt">查看完整第三方说明</a>。</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>可信本机，明确授权</dt>
        <dd>当前 Agent 面向单操作者，PM 账号与 Agent 身份独立，目录不是沙箱，不应直接开放到公网。<a href="/security/">阅读安全边界</a>。</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>状态与限制如实展示</dt>
        <dd>会话与持久化统一设计尚未收口；当前原生发行与许可门禁仍未闭合。<a href="/download/">查看发行证据</a>；未来云套餐<a href="/plans/">仍在规划、不可购买</a>。</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="next-step" class="section next-step" aria-labelledby="next-title">
  <div class="container next-step-inner">
    <div class="next-step-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">START WITH ONE REAL TASK</p>
      <h2 id="next-title">从一项任务，<br />开始理清你的工作。</h2>
      <p>先在自己的环境完成设置，再把项目上下文带入一次明确的对话。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="next-step-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/get-started/">开始自托管 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="/download/">查看发行与下载状态 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a class="text-link" href={appUrl}>已有实例？{appLabel} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .trust-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,.9fr) minmax(0,1.1fr); gap: 96px; }
  .trust-layout .section-head { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .trust-layout .section-head > a { margin-top: 24px; }
  .trust-facts { display: grid; gap: 24px; }
  .trust-facts > div + div { padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .trust-facts dt { margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; }
  .trust-facts dd { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.85; }
  .trust-facts a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .next-step { background: var(--accent-dim); }
  .next-step-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 64px; }
  .next-step-copy { max-width: 690px; }
  .next-step-copy .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .next-step-copy h2 { font-size: clamp(32px,3.8vw,48px); }
  .next-step-copy > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 600px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; }
  .next-step-actions { display: grid; gap: 12px; min-width: 272px; }
  .next-step-actions > .text-link { justify-content: center; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 13px; }
  @media (max-width: 1050px) {
    .trust-layout { gap: 48px; }
    .next-step-inner { gap: 40px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .trust-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
    .next-step-inner { align-items: start; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px; }
    .next-step-actions { min-width: 0; width: min(100%,380px); }
  }
</style>
